    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>At Le Brusc, in Six-Fours-les-Plages, Bruscain Paddle offers paddleboarding and kayaking outings in a sheltered bay, with sunset outings available to enjoy the evening light on the water.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>It's confirmed dog-friendly: the team takes special care of dogs heading out on a paddleboard with their human. A good way to share a water outing with your four-legged companion.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming to arrange the outing with your dog, especially if it's their first time on a paddleboard.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Le Brusc and its calm waters are well suited to a relaxed outing, with family or friends.</p>
